From c459ea7b31ddd004bf53b8e1cb63866c29debbde Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: well0nez <well0nez@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Fri, 2 Oct 2026 20:00:00 +0200
Subject: [PATCH 091/100] arm64: dts: allwinner: h713: device tree for the
 HY300PRO-G-EU

The tree configs/hy300pro_g_eu_defconfig names. An include of the HY310's
tree plus model and compatible, because this board is HY310-like where it
has been measured, and so that a boot log names the board it runs on. The
tree carries OF_UPSTREAM, so the file lands under dts/upstream/src/arm64/
allwinner/ and there is no Makefile line to add (as for 0041 and 0059).

Checked offline: compiled with the host cpp and dtc next to the HY310's, the
two trees differ in model and compatible and in nothing else.
---
 .../allwinner/sun50i-h713-hy300pro-g-eu.dts   | 20 +++++++++++++++++++
 1 file changed, 20 insertions(+)
 create mode 100644 dts/upstream/src/arm64/allwinner/sun50i-h713-hy300pro-g-eu.dts

diff --git a/dts/upstream/src/arm64/allwinner/sun50i-h713-hy300pro-g-eu.dts b/dts/upstream/src/arm64/allwinner/sun50i-h713-hy300pro-g-eu.dts
new file mode 100644
index 00000000000..6c59126771c
--- /dev/null
+++ b/dts/upstream/src/arm64/allwinner/sun50i-h713-hy300pro-g-eu.dts
@@ -0,0 +1,20 @@
+// SPDX-License-Identifier: (GPL-2.0+ OR MIT)
+/*
+ * HY300 Pro projector, box label HY300PRO-G-EU (stock Android 11 of
+ * 2025-05-06) -- the maintainer's own board. It is not the HY300 Pro of
+ * issue #1, whose tree is sun50i-h713-hy300-pro.dts.
+ *
+ * An include of the HY310's tree, because this board is HY310-like where it
+ * has been measured: the same DRAM words (they live in
+ * configs/hy300pro_g_eu_defconfig, not here), the same 26-entry partition
+ * table, the same display.bin. The panel (declared project id 0x34, 1280x720)
+ * is not described here; the display coprocessor drives it from its own
+ * tables. The tree exists so that a boot log names the board it runs on.
+ */
+
+#include "sun50i-h713-hy310.dts"
+
+/ {
+	model = "HY300 Pro (HY300PRO-G-EU)";
+	compatible = "magcubic,hy300pro-g-eu", "allwinner,sun50i-h713";
+};
